<title>UK: DePfa sets 100 mln mark step-up four-year bond.</title>
<headline>DePfa sets 100 mln mark step-up four-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following step-up callable pfandbrief was announced by lead manager Morgan Stanley.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DEUTSCHE PFANDBRIEF- UND HYPOTHEKENBANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN DEM   COUPON    *4.00	MATURITY  **27.DEC.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.65    PAY DATE    27.DEC.yr</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    FFURT     PAY FREQ  ***</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) ONE	 SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    HOME CTRY  GERMANY   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    10 BP     SELL CONC  1.65 PCT  PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>  NOTES     *FOR FIRST SIX MONTHS THEN 4.75 PCT.</p>
<p>	    **IT IS CALLABLE AFTER SIX MONTHS AT PAR.</p>
<p>	   ***TWO SEMI ANNUAL PAYMENTS THEN ANNUAL</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
